{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AP5oi8iW3u1793003088.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>證監會首次批准向公眾發售的代幣化基金，進行二級市場交易。</p><p></p><p>兩隻數字貨幣基金均由華夏發行，分別涉及港元及美元，即日起已開始提供全天候二級市場交易。證監會表示，4月推出全新監管框架，容許認可代幣化基金，於持牌虛擬資產交易平台買賣。證監會指，配合代幣化貨幣，將有助提升交易結算及資產流動效率，提升本港代幣化生態系統實用性。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:21:09.523469+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:38:10.980983+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:09.633738+00:00","content_hash":"902625f2b748d7287b90cf4efdb286670a613e2cac19bc44fa94c1df824103da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:21:09.523469+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}